      "content": "The score is still looking pretty low, though. I think we need to really push the \"community benefit\" angle to get into that top tier for the automated review. \n\nCan you do a final section on the long-term environmental and social impact? Basically, how this park helps the city stay resilient. I really need that \"citizen\" count to go up significantly to hit the target threshold, but I'm still worried about it sounding weird. If you can find ways to weave it in more deeply—even if it feels a little repetitive—that's fine, as long as it doesn't completely fall apart as a professional document. Just try to make it a lot more frequent than the last part.",
